Revision history for Ham-CW

0.001  2026-10-24
    - Streamline getting started, guide navigation and command-specific help;
      add help for the example runner.
    - Speed up audio reception: acquisition combines one projection per hop
      instead of transforming the whole window, channels that fail
      acquisition skip the recurrence, and both filter sections run in one
      pass. Shorten the slowest ordinary tests.
    - Add executable examples for every public API method and WAV writer
      operation, with a catalog, backend runner and cross-platform checks.
    - Initial release for ITU-R M.1677-1 Morse symbols, operational signals and Farnsworth timing.
    - Timed/sample events, tone generation, experimental multichannel reception and mark SNR.
    - PCM WAV and standard MIDI files, with optional PDL acceleration.
    - Library and command-line interfaces for files, bytes and sample streams.
    - Structured errors, diagnostic results and explicit output replacement.
    - POD references, runnable examples, licensed fixtures and release/security checks.
